// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_lnx_userdel.yml
// ID Sigma: 08f26069-6f80-474b-8d1f-d971c6fedea0
// Título: User Has Been Deleted Via Userdel
// Descripción: Detects execution of the "userdel" binary. Which is used to delete a user account and related files. This is sometimes abused by threat actors in order to cover their tracks
// Aplica a: Producto: linux | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: linux
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\linux\process_creation\proc_creation_lnx_userdel.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "/userdel"
